    "detailed_description": "Mawthorne is an NES game and playable on real NES hardware, and is now available on Steam! It is the 2nd game in the &quot;CGT-verse&quot; (the first being Shera and the 40 Thieves). Explore the ancient underground of this strange, alien world in this metroidvania platformer! Navigate your way through 9 different areas of the underground and encounter powerful bosses that make you stronger, open paths, or alter other areas of the world!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971810/extras/ffe8968843c03f221a00c7fb7db1ab4d.poster.avif?t=1653491270\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971810/extras/ffe8968843c03f221a00c7fb7db1ab4d.apng?t=1653491270\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open world consisting of 9 different areas to map out and explore.<br></li><li>Simple intuitive controls that allow you to attack, jump, and climb.<br></li><li>10 different bosses to conquer.<br></li><li>Health, power, and defense upgrades to discover.<br></li><li>NPCs to interact with for hints and uncover more of the story.<br></li><li>DPCM samples for improved music.<br></li><li>Features Remappable controls.</li></ul><br>Mawthorne was 400% successfully funded on Kickstarter.<br>Steam release made by possible with NESTEK from Lowtek Games.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971810/extras/59edb066370551e53b078cacb906813f.poster.avif?t=1653491270\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1971810/extras/59edb066370551e53b078cacb906813f.?t=1653491270\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea